7. Read ACL Development

A Read ACL was created for the u_institution_details table.

Configuration
Type: Record
Operation: Read
Name: u_institution_details
Active: True
Advanced: True
Required Role: bb1
Data Condition: Branch is EEE
Script
(function () {
    if (gs.hasRole('admin')) {
        return true;
    }

    if (gs.hasRole('bb1')) {
        return true;
    }

    return false;
})();

The ACL controls whether a user can read the records.

